{"n":98,"name":"Al-Bayyinah","nameAr":"البينة","meaning":"The Clear Proof","ayahs":8,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":30,"ar":"لَمْ يَكُنِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ مُنفَكِّينَ حَتَّىٰ تَأْتِيَهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","en":"Those who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture and the polytheists were not to be parted [from misbelief] until there came to them clear evidence","w":[{"ar":"لَمْ","tr":"lam","en":"Not"},{"ar":"يَكُنِ","tr":"yakuni","en":"were","root":"كون","lem":"كانَ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieved","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"أَهْلِ","tr":"ahli","en":"(the) People","root":"أهل","lem":"أَهْل"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","tr":"l-kitābi","en":"of the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"وَٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","tr":"wal-mush'rikīna","en":"and the polytheists","root":"شرك","lem":"مُشْرِك"},{"ar":"مُنفَكِّينَ","tr":"munfakkīna","en":"to be abandoned","root":"فكك","lem":"مُنفَكّ"},{"ar":"حَتَّىٰ","tr":"ḥattā","en":"until"},{"ar":"تَأْتِيَهُمُ","tr":"tatiyahumu","en":"(there) comes to them","root":"أتي","lem":"أَتَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","tr":"l-bayinatu","en":"the clear evidence","root":"بين","lem":"بَيِّنَة"}]},{"n":2,"juz":30,"ar":"رَسُولٌ مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ يَتْلُوا۟ صُحُفًا مُّطَهَّرَةً","en":"A Messenger from Allāh, reciting purified scriptures","w":[{"ar":"رَسُولٌۭ","tr":"rasūlun","en":"A Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"from"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يَتْلُوا۟","tr":"yatlū","en":"reciting","root":"تلو","lem":"تَلَى"},{"ar":"صُحُفًۭا","tr":"ṣuḥufan","en":"pages","root":"صحف","lem":"صُحُف"},{"ar":"مُّطَهَّرَةًۭ","tr":"muṭahharatan","en":"purified","root":"طهر","lem":"مُطَهَّرَة"}]},{"n":3,"juz":30,"ar":"فِيهَا كُتُبٌ قَيِّمَةٌ","en":"Within which are correct writings [i.e., rulings and laws].","w":[{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"Wherein"},{"ar":"كُتُبٌۭ","tr":"kutubun","en":"(are) writings","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"قَيِّمَةٌۭ","tr":"qayyimatun","en":"correct","root":"قوم","lem":"قَيِّمَة"}]},{"n":4,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَا تَفَرَّقَ ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوا۟ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ إِلَّا مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَتْهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","en":"Nor did those who were given the Scripture become divided until after there had come to them clear evidence.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"تَفَرَّقَ","tr":"tafarraqa","en":"became divided","root":"فرق","lem":"تَفَرَّقَ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"أُوتُوا۟","tr":"ūtū","en":"were given","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","tr":"l-kitāba","en":"the Book","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"until"},{"ar":"مِنۢ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"بَعْدِ","tr":"baʿdi","en":"after","root":"بعد","lem":"بَعْد"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"جَآءَتْهُمُ","tr":"jāathumu","en":"came (to) them","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْبَيِّنَةُ","tr":"l-bayinatu","en":"(of) the clear evidence","root":"بين","lem":"بَيِّنَة"}]},{"n":5,"juz":30,"ar":"وَمَآ أُمِرُوٓا۟ إِلَّا لِيَعْبُدُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ مُخْلِصِينَ لَهُ ٱلدِّينَ حُنَفَآءَ وَيُقِيمُوا۟ ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ وَيُؤْتُوا۟ ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ ۚ وَذَٰلِكَ دِينُ ٱلْقَيِّمَةِ","en":"And they were not commanded except to worship Allāh, [being] sincere to Him in religion, inclining to truth, and to establish prayer and to give zakāh. And that is the correct religion.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"And not"},{"ar":"أُمِرُوٓا۟","tr":"umirū","en":"they were commanded","root":"أمر","lem":"أَمَرَ"},{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"except"},{"ar":"لِيَعْبُدُوا۟","tr":"liyaʿbudū","en":"to worship","root":"عبد","lem":"عَبَدَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مُخْلِصِينَ","tr":"mukh'liṣīna","en":"(being) sincere","root":"خلص","lem":"مُخْلِص"},{"ar":"لَهُ","tr":"lahu","en":"to Him"},{